# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UnityDevCommonLib import tool ignores
#
# This is a Node/npm workspace (backend) plus Unity Editor sources (front end).
# It is NOT a Unity project: there is no Assets/ or ProjectSettings/ here, so
# Unity's generated directories only appear if someone opens it as one by mistake.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- OS noise ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Node -------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- editor / IDE state -----------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs

# --- .NET / Unity build output ---------------------------------------------
# bin/ and obj/ matter here: they are what the C# type-check harness produces.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.dll

# --- scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
*.local.json
*.local.md
# one-off probes written while debugging; never part of the tool
probe-*.mjs
probe-*.js
